Alembic migrations for the CPE OMR database.

The database URL is resolved in env.py from the CPE_DATABASE_URL environment
variable, defaulting to a local SQLite file (back/cpe_omr.db).

Common commands (run from back/):

    # apply all migrations
    alembic upgrade head

    # create a new migration after changing data/models.py
    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe change"

    # roll back the last migration
    alembic downgrade -1
